The model correctly classified **20,159 out of 20,160 test samples**, with only one misclassified sample.

### 🔹 Overall Outcome

The project demonstrates an end-to-end **IoT + Machine Learning + Web Application** architecture for water-quality monitoring and Safe/Unsafe classification.

```text
Water Sensors
     ↓
ESP32
     ↓
Wi-Fi
     ↓
Flask Backend
     ↓
RNN Model
     ↓
Safe / Unsafe Prediction
     ↓
Web Dashboard
```

> **Note:** The reported ML metrics are based on the reconstructed dataset and RNN implementation used in this repository. They represent model evaluation results and should not be interpreted as certified laboratory water-quality measurements.
